<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>HTML Image Activity</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>Displaying an Image</h2>
    
    <p>Here is a cute cat picture to demonstrate the image tag:</p>

    <!-- The img tag does not have a closing tag. 
         'src' points to the image link, and 'alt' provides alternate text. -->
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543852786-1cf6624b9987?w=400&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A cute cat looking at the camera" width="300">

</body>
</html>
